# Containers and cluster status for a fictional staging environment
$ cd ~/ops/staging
$ docker ps --format 'table {{.Names}}\t{{.Image}}\t{{.Status}}'
| NAMES        IMAGE                          STATUS
| relay-1      registry.corp.example/relay:4.2.0   Up 3 hours (healthy)
| relay-2      registry.corp.example/relay:4.2.0   Up 3 hours (healthy)
| ledger-db    postgres:16.4                  Up 3 days
| cache        redis:7.4-alpine               Up 3 days
| gateway      nginx:1.26-alpine              Up 3 days
$ docker logs --tail 6 relay-1
| 2026-11-09T19:45:01Z INFO  relay: accepted connection id=7f31 peer=10.4.0.18:48822
| 2026-11-09T19:45:01Z INFO  relay: session established id=7f31 cipher=chacha20-poly1305
| 2026-11-09T19:45:03Z INFO  relay: forwarded 2.4 KiB id=7f31 upstream=ledger-db
| 2026-11-09T19:45:04Z INFO  relay: heartbeat ok peers=14 queue=0
| 2026-11-09T19:45:09Z INFO  relay: key rotation scheduled in 3h12m
| 2026-11-09T19:45:09Z INFO  relay: heartbeat ok peers=14 queue=0
